{"title":"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the correct ordering of the three numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/8/b18e705cb4e33fb02736028bc220761b3755e8a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^8$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/90344030c1d8884b18daf2e4852bfd0c7cc0dc8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{12}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/0643eed365042783e35d23dfe6a360e78eff182b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{24}$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/776019fea772c5c893d87b9b54aaa5583a433573.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2^{24}&lt;10^8&lt;5^{12}\\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2^{24}&lt;5^{12}&lt;10^8 \\\\  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5^{12}&lt;2^{24}&lt;10^8 \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ 10^8&lt;5^{12}&lt;2^{24} \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ 10^8&lt;2^{24}&lt;5^{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"154\" height=\"98\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since all of the exponents are multiples of four, we can simplify the problem by taking the fourth root of each number. Evaluating we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b1421d715586fdca3f195bde54c1d482ab3bf016.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^2=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a3f26200911534c37a95b55a5baba4d3d4a113.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^3=125$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/3/c23f7dacd533c95a26bd926214b42d6cc00fb29f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^6=64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f35c6b8fba38bc7af36390c7b0514d8c8da8419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64&lt;100&lt;125$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"120\" height=\"13\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/4/bf4a38f0836cec6c72358c72b7b21e91876a7d53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2^{24}&lt;10^8&lt;5^{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"167\" height=\"31\" /> is the correct answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, let us make all exponents equal to 8. Then, it will be easy to order the numbers without doing any computations.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/8/b18e705cb4e33fb02736028bc220761b3755e8a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^8$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" /> is as fine as it is.\nWe can rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/0643eed365042783e35d23dfe6a360e78eff182b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{24}$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61e0252608634b9e743786625fe7ae3370281b48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^3)^8=8^8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"21\" />.\nThen we can rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/90344030c1d8884b18daf2e4852bfd0c7cc0dc8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{12}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/8049d55f545479ac18ad8a841af6605805126715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5^{\\frac{3}{2}})^8=(\\sqrt{125})^8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"22\" />.\nWe take the eighth root of all of these to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/2/5221c973adef93d7e47ed4ce914e784e37c7f422.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${10, 8, \\sqrt{125}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" />.\nObviously, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee57a9e6e1314792b93c77c7e146834192ad65c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8&lt;10&lt;\\sqrt{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/4/bf4a38f0836cec6c72358c72b7b21e91876a7d53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2^{24}&lt;10^8&lt;5^{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"167\" height=\"31\" />.\nSolution by Math\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35401d3881347bff8024408bedc03dd8b9876df2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{8}=({5}\\cdot{2})^{8}=5^{8}\\cdot2^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"175\" height=\"21\" />. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d84588ffb268d16b12f0da704992128df3e37bab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{12}=5^{(8+4)}=5^{8}\\cdot5^{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />. If we remove the common factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48e4267158fe57c065932759da9143295061f6e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> from both expressions, we are left with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd2870a6308f6ab3f7877790a1cfab9857e896a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" />, which equals 256, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec625f8e70794239492606db42645451e2978e0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{4}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, which equals 625. So we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/90344030c1d8884b18daf2e4852bfd0c7cc0dc8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{12}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> is bigger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/042fb2003cdf1b7d0707c92c84c8a805e03dbb72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" />. Now we need to figure out which is bigger, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/042fb2003cdf1b7d0707c92c84c8a805e03dbb72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/0643eed365042783e35d23dfe6a360e78eff182b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{24}$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" />. To do this, we rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/0643eed365042783e35d23dfe6a360e78eff182b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{24}$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/9/d9906c60f6da8648bf36b7a83bd532ba93ea7794.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{3})^{8}=(8)^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"21\" />, which is clearly less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/042fb2003cdf1b7d0707c92c84c8a805e03dbb72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/4/bf4a38f0836cec6c72358c72b7b21e91876a7d53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2^{24}&lt;10^8&lt;5^{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"167\" height=\"31\" /> is the correct answer.\n</p><p>By naman14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rQUwNC0gqdg?t=381\">https://youtu.be/rQUwNC0gqdg?t=381</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks\">Video by MathTalks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mSCQzmfdX-g\">https://youtu.be/mSCQzmfdX-g</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EfCyJF1FEO\">https://youtu.be/EfCyJF1FEO</a>\n~a person\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 8\">2010 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2010\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017002758\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 228/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2272/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5523/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.202      1 -total\n 58.50%    7.138      1 Template:AMC8_box\n 39.80%    4.856      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:10437:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017002758 and revision id 264544. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}